[?2004l19:468:## Investigation Brief 03 — Compliance Mail Timing
20-469:
21-470:Extract policy (authoritative):
22-471:
23-472:The March mail-room audit explained missing holds: agents applied compliance
24-473:messages without checking dispatch dates. When an excerpt includes
25-474:`sent: YYYY-MM-DD`, apply the status change only if sent is greater than or
26-475:equal to the ledger date for that transaction. When no `sent:` line is present,
27-476:apply the status change if precedence allows. Correction notices always apply
28-477:after ledger rows, meeting amendments, and mail excerpts have been merged.
