[?2004l16:685:## Investigation Brief 04 — Correction Notice Precedence
17-686:
18-687:Controller memo (binding reconciliation rule):
19-688:
20-689:The corrections desk ships multiple notices per field. When several notices
21-690:target the same transaction and field, the notice with the lexicographically
22-691:greatest `effective` date wins. For each winning notice, `previous_value` in
23-692:`reconciliation_report.jsonl` is the field value immediately before that notice
24-693:applies (after ledger, amendments, and emails). Owner corrections override
25-694:both ledger owners and signed meeting amendments when applied in this step.
