253-
254-Auditor directive (mandatory for extract):
255-
256-Interview notes with the compliance desk confirmed status fights between mail,
257-amendments, and corrections. Ledger rows provide the base status (lowercase on
258-output). Status precedence from lowest to highest is: pending, approved,
259-rejected, reversed. Email excerpts may change status only when the From line
260-contains `compliance@` anywhere in the address; ignore all other senders.
